{"ref":"BDB, פְּלֵתִי","hw":"פְּלֵתִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלֵתִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> from unknown n.pr.; only c. art. as n. coll. with <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכְּרֵתִי</span> (q.v.) of David’s guard <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.18\">2 S 8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.18\">15:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.7\">20:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.38\">1 K 1:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.17\">1 Ch 18:17</a>.","next":"BDB, פֶּן־","prev":"BDB, פֶּ֫לֶת"}